    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Over 115 children in Tanzania participated in a World Environment Day activity facilitated by AKU's Institute for Educational Development, East Africa. This was an initiative led by the Master of Education (MEd) students who established an AKU Environmental Club to raise awareness on environmental sustainability.",
